**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Chapter Nine’s narrative, verbatim: Transoxiana, the Roof of the World and beyond, and the Mythic
> Steppe.
> Records: the chapter’s covenants and people in `…-the-silk-road-*.actor`; its records in `…-the-silk-road-*.ttrpg`; sidebars in `…-the-silk-road-sidebars.ttrpg`; its places in `…-setting.setting`.

